WEBVTT

NOTE
Timing follows the delivered mix cue sheet, including the 4.5-second studio opening.

1
00:00:04.950 --> 00:00:08.950
<v Cyber Creep>Custodian online. Occupants unresolved.

2
00:00:09.800 --> 00:00:11.400
<v Vix>Contact, twelve o'clock!

3
00:00:12.850 --> 00:00:14.690
<v Narrator>Qind Qompany is hiring.

4
00:00:15.650 --> 00:00:18.430
<v Narrator>We keep the world's essential facilities running.

5
00:00:18.220 --> 00:00:19.320
<v Narrator>Bathhouses.

6
00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:20.920
<v Narrator>Power stations.

7
00:00:22.442 --> 00:00:23.502
<v Narrator>Airmail.

8
00:00:25.017 --> 00:00:28.057
<v Narrator>But something has moved into the machines.

9
00:00:27.642 --> 00:00:29.742
<v Cyber Creep>Your resistance is logged.

10
00:00:39.200 --> 00:00:42.380
<v Narrator>It is... highly motivated.

11
00:00:42.600 --> 00:00:43.960
<v Narrator>So we're hiring.

12
00:00:43.480 --> 00:00:46.280
<v Narrator>Every life, the roster deals you someone new.

13
00:00:47.350 --> 00:00:48.310
<v CyberPengu>Sliding through!

14
00:00:50.200 --> 00:00:51.240
<v Ducké>Decoy out!

15
00:00:51.800 --> 00:00:53.400
<v Ducké>Squawk! Wrong way!

16
00:00:53.600 --> 00:00:54.800
<v Vix>Overclocking!

17
00:00:57.950 --> 00:00:59.070
<v Cache>Supplies here!

18
00:01:00.650 --> 00:01:01.290
<v Mochi>Cushion up!

19
00:01:05.250 --> 00:01:06.450
<v Hex>Going ghost.

20
00:01:07.550 --> 00:01:09.550
<v Patches>Hold still. Welding.

21
00:01:12.650 --> 00:01:14.970
<v Axi>Diagnosis: terminal.

22
00:01:14.500 --> 00:01:16.420
<v CyberPengu>Shift starts now, team! Let's go!

23
00:01:17.050 --> 00:01:18.970
<v Narrator>Flexible hours.

24
00:01:18.367 --> 00:01:19.887
<v Ducké>Contact, nine o'clock!

25
00:01:25.058 --> 00:01:26.178
<v Vix>Try to keep up.

26
00:01:28.692 --> 00:01:30.132
<v Narrator>Full medical coverage.

27
00:01:30.342 --> 00:01:31.622
<v Mochi>Didn't even feel it.

28
00:01:31.825 --> 00:01:33.905
<v Mochi>Stay close. I've got you.

29
00:01:33.992 --> 00:01:34.952
<v Cache>Push now!

30
00:01:36.408 --> 00:01:38.648
<v Narrator>Management sees the whole board.

31
00:01:42.467 --> 00:01:44.187
<v Cyber Creep>Repair cluster required.

32
00:01:44.450 --> 00:01:46.250
<v Narrator>When they cut the power...

33
00:01:46.650 --> 00:01:47.870
<v Narrator>...bring the light.

34
00:01:50.350 --> 00:01:51.790
<v Cache>Contact, three o'clock!

35
00:01:52.050 --> 00:01:54.330
<v Patches>If it breaks, I mend it.

36
00:01:54.950 --> 00:01:57.030
<v Ducké>Eyes high. Routes clear.

37
00:02:07.100 --> 00:02:08.520
<v Narrator>Full training provided.

38
00:02:16.350 --> 00:02:20.150
<v Narrator>Eight crew. Five chassis. Three stations.

39
00:02:21.842 --> 00:02:22.882
<v Vix>Push now!

40
00:02:26.700 --> 00:02:27.660
<v Cache>Cover me!

41
00:02:30.317 --> 00:02:31.597
<v CyberPengu>You should have watched the floor!

42
00:02:33.600 --> 00:02:35.600
<v Narrator>No experience necessary.

43
00:02:40.200 --> 00:02:42.200
<v Narrator>We take care of our people.

44
00:02:42.750 --> 00:02:44.130
<v Hex>...Mostly.

45
00:02:46.100 --> 00:02:48.600
<v Narrator>Qind Qompany. Origin of Species.

46
00:02:50.300 --> 00:02:52.060
<v CyberPengu>Slide fast. Help faster.

